Layered Architecture

Controllers
Services
Repository
Models

Controllers: First point of contact -> APIs

In TicTacToe we don't have any APIs So instead of APIs we will have methods to play the games in the controller.

Service: Logics for Winner, Draw etc ...

Repository: Since it is not persistent, we do need not store anything. Hence No repository needed.


Strategy Design:
1. Bot Difficulty
2. Winning Strategy

